    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanangu Timothi, manya kukala siku za mwisho zindakala za tabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana atu andadzimendza, andamendza pesa, andakala na ngulu, na andadziona muhimu kuriko anjina. Andalaphiza ovyo ovyo, taandaogopha avyazi ao, tsona andakala atu asio na shukurani na asiomuogopha Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu andakala asiomendza wala kuswamehe ayawao, tsona afyakatsi, asiodzizuwiya, akatili na asiohamirwa ni chitu chochosi chinono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya andakala asalatadzi, asiojali chitu, atu a kudzinyobola na kumendza raha za dunia kuriko kumendza Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao andaonekana avi anaogopha Mlungu, ela andakahala nguvuze. Phahi atu dza hinyo, dzitenge nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anjina aho nkudziinjiza midzi ya achetu enye nia nyonje, achahala zewe hara ambao ahendwa atumwa ni dambi na kulongozwa ni tamaa mbii za chila aina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila wakati achetu hinyo nkudzifundza mambo maphya, ela ukpweli taaweza kuumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinyo atu anapinga ukpweli dza viratu Yane na Yambire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:8",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yane na Yambire",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": Higa ni madzina ambago tagamo kpwenye Chilagane cha Kare. Inaaminika kukala madzina higa ni hara Amisiri airi atsai ambao ampinga Musa ariphokala analonda kulongoza Aiziraeli kula Misiri. (Soma chitabu cha",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 7:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.7.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " arivyompinga Musa. Achili zao zabanangika na kukuluphira kpwao ni kpwa bure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao taandafika kure, mana upumbavu wao undamanyikana wazi na chila mutu, dza viratu upumbavu wa Yane na Yambire urivyomanyikana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela uwe Timothi, unamanya mambo gosi nifundzago, vira ninavyosagala na atu, na lengo ra maisha gangu. Piya unamanya rira ninarokuluphira, ninavyovumirira, na ninavyomendza atu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.13.14+ACT.13.15+ACT.13.16+ACT.13.17+ACT.13.18+ACT.13.19+ACT.13.20+ACT.13.21+ACT.13.22+ACT.13.23+ACT.13.24+ACT.13.25+ACT.13.26+ACT.13.27+ACT.13.28+ACT.13.29+ACT.13.30+ACT.13.31+ACT.13.32+ACT.13.33+ACT.13.34+ACT.13.35+ACT.13.36+ACT.13.37+ACT.13.38+ACT.13.39+ACT.13.40+ACT.13.41+ACT.13.42+ACT.13.43+ACT.13.44+ACT.13.45+ACT.13.46+ACT.13.47+ACT.13.48+ACT.13.49+ACT.13.50+ACT.13.51+ACT.13.52"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 13:14–52",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.1+ACT.14.2+ACT.14.3+ACT.14.4+ACT.14.5+ACT.14.6+ACT.14.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 14:1–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.14.8+ACT.14.9+ACT.14.10+ACT.14.11+ACT.14.12+ACT.14.13+ACT.14.14+ACT.14.15+ACT.14.16+ACT.14.17+ACT.14.18+ACT.14.19+ACT.14.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mahendo 14:8–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona unamanya vira nrivyogaya na kuphaha mateso, hasa gara garigoniphaha hiko midzi ya Antiokia, Ikonio na Lisitira. Mino kuko náhenderwa mateso makulu, ela Bwana Jesu wanitivya na tabu zosi hizo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kpweli chila mutu ndiyelonda kusagala masagazi ga kumuogopha Mlungu kpwa kumkuluphira Masihi Jesu, andateswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela atu ayi na alimu a handzo andaenderera kuchenga ayawao na kuchengbwa, nao andazidi kukala ayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
